DAO: BancorDAO
Role: Organisasi otonom terdesentralisasi mengelola parameter protokol (fee, whitelist, upgrade, treasury allocation) via on-chain voting + Snapshot signaling
Status: Active
Sources: https://snapshot.org/#/bancor.eth
